measured: the router's histograms (server side, the same scrape as the inputs): TTFT from the request's arrival at the router, its queue included; TPOT per streamed request. Each step is priced at the inputs of the same window its histogram covers
assumed: random (Poisson) arrivals: the recording does not measure how bursty arrivals are; state it with --arrival-cv2 (arrivalCV2) when known

